          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Suspected testicular degeneration (dogs)—a repeat semen analysis performed at least 70 days after correcting any identified underlying cause is needed before long-term prognosis can be assessed.",
